WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.093
The reason doesn't matter.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:14.681
Nor that this man is my enemy.

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:19.936
Nor that someone put me to sleep.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.273
What matters...

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.525
is that for hours,

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.444
this man, on the brink of death...

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.571
although I am his enemy...

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.197
protected me!

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:38.371
What remains is the fact
that I was protected by this man!

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:42.208
I will not let him die!

00:00:46.254 --> 00:00:48.548
The first floor of the Shin Shin Kai HQ...

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:51.593
has a treatment room staffed
with a doctor!

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:18.578
Only the back?

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:21.581
Apologies! My name is Retsu.

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:24.250
You can contact me
at the Shin Shin Kai Karate Dojo!

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.922
Karate?

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.256
Kung Fu?

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.595
Our destination is just past this...

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.765
One kilometer to the bridge.

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:43.103
I have no other choice.

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:45.772
Distance, 10 meters.

00:01:46.147 --> 00:01:49.025
About 700 to 800 steps.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:56.282
It won't be a problem for about 15 meters!

00:02:06.668 --> 00:02:08.962
He's crossing... the river...

00:02:17.011 --> 00:02:18.179
With two of us...

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.432
we can't help but sink.

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:25.812
No one's going to believe this.
Even if I tell someone.

00:02:33.403 --> 00:02:35.989
I apologize for the disturbance!

